demy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/state.json" "file_sha256" "315f98713864cf7d17ffc252fe9128bf9f8f8ff78019fc93f45a94227ddbc43b" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-42970" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,4 & 13 \\\\ -2 & 19\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,4 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}|}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/state.json" "file_sha256" "315f98713864cf7d17ffc252fe9128bf9f8f8ff78019fc93f45a94227ddbc43b" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-42970" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,7 & 13 \\\\ -5 & 19\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,4 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}|}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/state.json" "file_sha256" "315f98713864cf7d17ffc252fe9128bf9f8f8ff78019fc93f45a94227ddbc43b" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-42970" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,4 & 13 \\\\ -2 & 19\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,4 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 5\\end{aligned}|}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/state.json" "file_sha256" "315f98713864cf7d17ffc252fe9128bf9f8f8ff78019fc93f45a94227ddbc43b" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70252" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $⟨-1,y⟩$ be the solution of the system of equations below. \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2x+ky=-4 \\\\ 3x-4y=5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following equations could be solved to find the value of $k?$\n\n- $|\\begin{aligned}2 & k \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}|=-2|\\begin{aligned}-4 & k \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|$\n- $|\\begin{aligned}2 & k \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}|=|\\begin{aligned}-4 & k \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|$\n- $|\\begin{aligned}2 & k \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}|=-|\\begin{aligned}-4 & k \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/state.json" "file_sha256" "315f98713864cf7d17ffc252fe9128bf9f8f8ff78019fc93f45a94227ddbc43b" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70252" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The determinant of the coefficient matrix is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & k \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAccording to Cramer's rule, the value of $x$ is given by $x=\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D},$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{x} & =|\\begin{aligned}-4 & k \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D} \\\\ -1 & =\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}-4 & k \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}2 & k \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}|} \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}2 & k \\\\ 3 & -4\\end{aligned}| & =-|\\begin{aligned}-4 & k \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{aligned}|\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"III only\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/state.json" "file_sha256" "315f98713864cf7d17ffc252fe9128bf9f8f8ff78019fc93f45a94227ddbc43b" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70252" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bdb98914303911996d27ba6ad272178e6a8b8b2a5eaa5abf591d823574ec8381" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70252" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/state.json" "file_sha256" "315f98713864cf7d17ffc252fe9128bf9f8f8ff78019fc93f45a94227ddbc43b" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70252" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "I and II only"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/state.json" "file_sha256" "315f98713864cf7d17ffc252fe9128bf9f8f8ff78019fc93f45a94227ddbc43b" "basis" 1856 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14057622/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-70252" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "