estion" "q-42607" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "We are given the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x+6y=32 \\\\ 3x+5y=26.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe determinant of the coefficient matrix is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we construct ${D}_{x}$, we replace the first column of the coefficient matrix by the right-hand side column of the given system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{x} & =|\\begin{aligned}32 & 6 \\\\ 26 & 5\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, according to Cramer's rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D}=\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}32 & 6 \\\\ 26 & 5\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059292/state.json" "file_sha256" "6f28d8663707bdac34d79d0b5fb77fa58ac5ad9a2913fbca7f98996d05e737da"} {"question" "q-42607" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059292/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7a247b7a09436cd5392e601aa57c65530d21395458140efd75cbf85db83b830f"} {"question" "q-42607" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059292/state.json" "file_sha256" "6f28d8663707bdac34d79d0b5fb77fa58ac5ad9a2913fbca7f98996d05e737da"} {"question" "q-42607" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}10 & 6 \\\\ 26 & 5\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}6 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}|}"] ["math" "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}3 & 6 \\\\ 26 & 5\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|}"]